<concept id="concept-2883" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic concept/concept "><title class="- topic/title ">HOS status page</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">An overview of the HOS-related workflows on the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Status</wintitle> page of <keyword conkeyref="varsProductnames/003" class="- topic/keyword "/>.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">Example Author &lt;author@example.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><keyword class="- topic/keyword "></keyword><keyword class="- topic/keyword "></keyword><keyword class="- topic/keyword "></keyword><keyword class="- topic/keyword "></keyword></keywords><prodinfo class="- topic/prodinfo "><prodname class="- topic/prodname "></prodname></prodinfo><othermeta name="aiSearchSummary" content="Covers the HOS status page in Geotab Drive: reviewing your availability, changing your duty status, viewing your cycle recap, and changing your ruleset." class="- topic/othermeta "/><othermeta name="aiSearchSummary-source-hash" content="f431c0cb0a1c949412cb2b49c53745bf300c530a25e71ed628da79f4d870b798" class="- topic/othermeta "/><othermeta name="aiSearchKeywords-source-hash" content="f431c0cb0a1c949412cb2b49c53745bf300c530a25e71ed628da79f4d870b798" class="- topic/othermeta "/></metadata></prolog><conbody class="- topic/body  concept/conbody "><p class="- topic/p ">Tap <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">HOS</uicontrol> on the <ph conkeyref="varsUI/dashboardPage" class="- topic/ph "><wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle "/></ph> and then choose the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Status</uicontrol> tab near the top of the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">HOS</wintitle> page.</p><p class="- topic/p "><image href="../../Images/HOS_and_ELD/Geotab_Drive_HOS_status_tab.png" class="- topic/image "/></p><p class="- topic/p ">